# {{ factory.factory.name }} — the Analysis Factory (v{{ factory.schema_version }})

A git-native, **domain-agnostic analysis factory** — a pure tool. Input: a raw product idea + a
domain profile. Output: reviewed, versioned, traceable analysis artifacts and **backend + frontend
execution plans**, written into the **project repo** every consumer mounts. Boundary:
**{{ factory.factory.boundary }}** — it never implements, never audits implementations inside the line, never runs tests inside the line.

This checkout carries no project: `${{ factory.project.checkout_env }}` (default `{{ factory.project.checkout_default }}`) names the
project repo it drives, and switching projects is pointing it elsewhere. Everything below is generated from
`factory.yaml` by `gov.py render`; the constitution that governs the tool is `shared/CONSTITUTION.md`.

